  "bodyText": "Skip to content\nConversions\nDress Like Mommy | Matching Family Outfits\ndresslikemommy.com\n1\nConversions\nManage your conversion tracking with the help of our conversions page. Learn More\nEvents overview\nEvent quality\n,\nTest events\nPinterest tag\nTag manager\nConversions API\nSet up API\nConversion upload\nUpload file\nUpload history\nEvents overview\nSelect a date range\nCustom events are now available\nPinterest has added custom events to provide more flexibility in how you measure and optimize campaigns. Custom events can provide you with deeper insights and more accurate reporting to help you meet your business goals. Set up your custom events to start using them today. Learn more\nNew standard event types available\nWe've added six new standard events, including Contact, Schedule, FindLocation, CustomizeProduct, SubmitApplication and StartTrial. These new event types will help provide you with more accurate reporting and insights.\nNote: If you were already sending these event types to Pinterest but they previously mapped to other events, you'll start to see your events categorized under these new event types moving forward.\nAll events overview\nConversions API\nPinterest Tag\nConversion upload\nMMP\nEvents overview shows data from all sources after duplicate events are removed\nPageVisit\nViewCategory\nAddToCart\nInitiateCheckout\nSearch\nCheckout\nAddPaymentInfo\n500\n1k\n1.5k\nApr 12\nApr 19\nApr 26\nMay 3\nEvents Activity\nView events activity information by event type.\nEvent table data\nEvent name\n\t\nEvent source\n\t\nTotal events\n\t\nLast received date\n\t\nDetails\n\n\nPageVisit\n\t\nApi · Tag\n\t\n19,957\n\t\n5/8/2026 05:27am (UTC)\n\t\n\n\nViewCategory\n\t\nApi · Tag\n\t\n4,206\n\t\n5/8/2026 04:04am (UTC)\n\t\n\n\nAddToCart\n\t\nApi · Tag\n\t\n714\n\t\n5/8/2026 03:59am (UTC)\n\t\n\n\nInitiateCheckout\n\t\nApi · Tag\n\t\n133\n\t\n5/8/2026 04:56am (UTC)\n\t\n\n\nSearch\n\t\nApi · Tag\n\t\n51\n\t\n5/7/2026 11:37pm (UTC)\n\t\n\